974 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 260 0 R/E(The MSME Idea Hackathon 5.0 is a prestigious national-level initiative conducted by the Ministry of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises, Government of India, aimed at fostering innovation and entrepreneurship among students in alignment with Industry 4.0 and 5.0 technologies. The hackathon serves as a platform for young innovators to propose scalable, technology-driven solutions addressing real-world challenges in the MSME ecosystem.)/Pg 52 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

975 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 260 0 R/E(In this event, Nirupathunga M presented "SmartSync 4.0," an AI-powered Digital Twin Platform designed to revolutionize manufacturing processes within MSME units. The solution leverages digital twin technology integrated with artificial intelligence to enable real-time monitoring, predictive maintenance, and intelligent process optimization \204 bridging the gap between traditional manufacturing and smart Industry 4.0/5.0 practices.)/Pg 52 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

