<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 271 0 R/E(Sri Ramakrishna Institute of Technology provided an inspiring opportunity for student innovators to present their AI-based project Metal Vista \(Visual Intelligence System for Transparent Analysis\) to the Honorable Vice Chairman of AICTE, Dr. Abhay Jere.This interaction served as a prestigious platform to showcase student research and innovation at a national leadership level. The presentation highlighted the team\220s efforts in applying artificial intelligence for advanced transparent analysis and intelligent metal classification systems.The session offered valuable feedback, insights, and encouragement from the esteemed expert, motivating the students to further refine and scale their idea for broader impact.)/Pg 63 0 R/K[8]>>
