1303 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 285 0 R/E(Sri Ramakrishna Institute of Technology successfully conducted Day 1 of LEARNATHON \205 Unlock the Power of AI, a hands-on workshop focused on introducing students to the fundamentals of Neural Networks and AI Model Creation.The session provided participants with an engaging learning experience on how artificial intelligence systems work, emphasizing brain-like learning processes and the core concepts behind modern AI development.This workshop encouraged students to explore AI technologies without requiring prior coding knowledge, making it an accessible and impactful introduction to the world of intelligent systems.)/Pg 77 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

1304 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 285 0 R/T(Outcome:)/E(Outcome:)/Pg 77 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

1305 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 285 0 R/E(The workshop strengthened students\220 understanding of foundational AI concepts and inspired them to pursue further learning in emerging technologies. Participants gained confidence in exploring neural network applications and were motivated to engage in future AI-based innovation and research activities through HIVE and ASME platforms.)/Pg 77 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

