1323 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 287 0 R/E(The ASME\205SRIT Student Section organized a meaningful community outreach visit to the Senior Citizens Home at Mathipalayam, Thenkarai, Coimbatore, as a step towards spreading compassion and social responsibility.Nearly 25 student members participated in the visit and spent valuable time interacting with the elderly residents. The session was filled with warmth, smiles, and heartfelt conversations, creating memorable moments of joy and connection across generations.The initiative reflected ASME\220s commitment not only to technical excellence but also to nurturing empathy, kindness, and community engagement among future engineers.)/Pg 79 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

