1464 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 296 0 R/E(Sri Ramakrishna Institute of Technology, through its innovation hub HIVE, successfully conducted a Winter Internship Program offering students an intensive, hands-on experience across multiple cutting-edge technical and research domains. The internship was designed to bridge the gap between academic learning and real-world application, enabling students to work on live projects under the mentorship of experienced faculty and industry professionals.)/Pg 91 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

1465 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 296 0 R/E(The program spanned several specialized domains, allowing students to contribute meaningfully to ongoing research, digital development, and technology initiatives at the institute. )/Pg 91 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

1466 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 296 0 R/T(Outcome:)/E(Outcome:)/Pg 91 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

1467 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 296 0 R/E(The Winter Internship Program under HIVE provided students with a transformative learning experience that extended well beyond the classroom. Participants developed technical proficiency in their respective domains, improved their problem-solving abilities, and gained confidence in executing real-world projects. The program fostered a culture of innovation, collaboration, and entrepreneurial thinking, aligning with HIVE's mission to nurture the next generation of technologists and innovators at SRIT.)/Pg 91 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

