1484 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 298 0 R/E(As part of the HIVE Winter Internship Program, a team of five students \204 Keerthivasan P, Kamaleshwaran P, Nandhini T, Nirupathunga M, and Krishnakanth J \204 successfully conceptualized, developed, and deployed an immersive 360\260 Virtual Tour of the SRIT Campus, now live at www.srit.org/srittour/. The project provided an end-to-end development experience encompassing site planning, interactive navigation, hotspot annotations, and web deployment \204 making the campus digitally accessible to prospective students, parents, alumni, and visitors from anywhere in the world. The successful live deployment of this tour on the institute's official domain stands as a tangible, high-impact outcome of the internship, reflecting the students' technical growth and HIVE's commitment to transforming student talent into real-world solutions.)/Pg 93 0 R/K[7 1707 0 R 9]>>
endobj

